branding-ubuntu (0.5) natty; urgency=low

  * Switch to native version number, there is no separate upstream for this
    package.
  * debian/control: Bump Standards-Version to 3.9.1 (no changes necessary).
  * Switch to 3.0 (native) source format.
  * debian/rules: Rewrite using dh, which greatly simplifies the file.
  * debian/branding-ubuntu.{preinst,postrm}: Add missing debhelper token.
  * debian/copyright: Point to GPL version 2.
  * debian/branding-ubuntu.{preinst,postrm}: Fix syntax, use dash instead of
    bash, and run with set -e.
  * debian/rules: Build with scour for SVG optimization. Add python-scour
    build dependency.

